msgid "Your tournament configuration allows feedback to be submitted online by participants. The draw <a href=\"%(display_url)s\" class=\"alert-link\">must be released</a> before they can do so for this round."
msgstr "tvoj/tvoja turnaj configuration allows sp?tn?v?zba na by?odoslan?online pod?a??astn?ci/??astn??ky.?reb <a href=\"%(display_url)s\" class=\"alert-link\">mus?pod?a?zverejnen?</a> pred oni m??e do tak?e pre toto kolo."

